title: can be represented in skg using links
pid: b195e3f7-7e55-4e28-a521-dcb673565c51
body: |2-
  Consider a presentation forest like this:
  #+begin_example
  - X
  -- Y
  -- Z
  - A
  -- X', which links to X
  --- Y', which links to Y
  --- B
  #+end_example
  Here A is saying:
  "X is relevant to me.
  Of what X presents, Y is especially relevant.
  B also helps understand/define the relationship between myself and X."
contains:
- fb02a19a-9cdb-4f64-bd30-a416915b15b4
